  "label": "Racist Evolutionary Juxtaposition",
  "description": "This is a visual trope that juxtaposes a primate with a human to imply a supposed evolutionary gap. It is used in the meme to suggest that Black people are 'less evolved' than white people, which is a false and harmful stereotype. The trope is rooted in racist ideologies and is used to dehumanize Black people.",
